  "content": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Y38NNKac3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lcKvuW.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>  \n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Javieljefe/posts/villagers-reborn-161251490\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FQUxwX9.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjavieljefe\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2o5H7aP.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>    \n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Javieljefe/Villagers-Reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iEov6p6.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p>您可以在此處免費關注開發進度、開發日誌以及未來更新&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/collection/2146365?view=expanded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong>&nbsp;📝</p>\n<p>如果您想支持該項目，可以請我喝杯&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjavieljefe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ko-fi</strong></a>&nbsp;☕</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/157868171\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83QcmPt.png\" alt=\"Cover\"></a></p>\n<p><strong><h2>模組合集 ⚔️</h2></strong></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagers-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7DMzqFk.png\" alt=\"Villagers Reborn\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>  \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasy-knights-factions\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u4aFHD4.png\" alt=\"Fantasy Factions\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survival-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x6COPTt.png\" alt=\"Survival Needs\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>    \n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-walk\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r35zoWX.png\" alt=\"Immersive Walk\" width=\"200\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>寶可夢屬性表（Cobblemon / Pixelmon）</strong></h1>\n<p>這是一個簡單的模組，將寶可夢的屬性相克表加入了 Minecraft。</p>\n<p>它<strong>與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></strong>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pixelmon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixelmon</a></strong>&nbsp;或其他任何模組兼容運行！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 按住鼠標右鍵點擊手中的物品即可打開屬性表。</p>\n<p>- 您也可以使用默認鍵 <strong>H</strong> 打開（可在控制設置 - 鍵位綁定中修改）。</p>\n<p>- 提供 8 種不同的顏色方案供屬性表使用。</p>\n<p>- 圖標可選擇顯示或隱藏邊框，可在遊戲內的模組選項或直接配置文件（cobblemontypechart-common.toml）中切換。</p>\n<p>- 要在遊戲內直接更改設置，您需要安裝 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模組完全為客戶端運行，可在任何原版或模組服務器上使用。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>屬性表</strong></h2>\n<p>遊戲內屬性表 <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_a012d1f2-f206-44df-a179-85799d232d49.png\" alt=\"In-game type table\"></p>\n<h2><strong>工具提示</strong></h2>\n<p>將鼠標懸停在屬性圖標上即可查看其克制關係<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_c3b16dac-c41f-451e-8cb8-1154eb485ce8.png\" alt=\"A visual reference for the tooltips\"></p>\n<h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2>\n<p>合成配方（2 張紙 + 1 個鐵錠）+ 染料以獲得不同顏色。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354015/description_70bbba5b-d8d4-4922-9379-d416a70e76bb.png\" alt=\"The in-game recipe for the new item\"></p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：如果您未使用帶有 <strong>Iris</strong>、<strong>OptiFine</strong> 或類似模組的<strong>光影</strong>，屬性表可能會顯得模糊。若要在不使用光影的情況下修復此問題，請進入視頻設置 - <strong>菜單背景模糊</strong>並將其設置為<strong>關閉</strong>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/villagers-reborn-159604973\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kWexfa8.png\" alt=\"Cover\"></a></p>",
